x/tools' own fixtures for directive, golang.org/x/tools@v0.50.0 go/analysis/passes/directive/testdata/src/a,
each file byte for byte as upstream holds it, extracted at test time into a temporary GOPATH. They are an archive,
not files under src, because cohere's gofmt guard reads every Go file under testdata, and badspace.go is not
gofmt-clean as upstream wrote it.
